  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cf787fdbe714fd434d1f29b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家一起嗨起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6d14f7f9cc9ea5e58bd5fa2585743ccad8abeab437620a025864061f6983a9a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56a955c7f2e0a8e1d56a5082",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我赋予你和圣王一起朝更高目标迈进的权利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a2e837a952de98049ed8635277e4a6bc20fbd16c7ec0cf383f996f7508eb1b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52eb74282f3dff3344c44cb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣王是不会回顾过去\r\n的哦…但如果是跟你的\r\n回忆的话，倒也可以回想一下。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5620f54edf1f34546d675899ad8b95f34680c970617636f76d54928a6f5c9082",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f86968eb94bc5efdec9a681b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如何？有种一流优等生的感觉吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4acc1be0765c9770d554992b11304d370a3614478610f14907dfeed6729b0c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b5d1e805ebb6a2b41a495de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "华丽又惹人怜，很不错嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "224ed25f1ca215fae4eabc94af62aff93ebbfae6420678ecda9b1a97e3d7f400",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4308c9ee00ab98b8e8fa347",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦ー吼吼吼！\r\n决胜服就是会让我兴致高昂呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf6b0616be2fcfcfce448edff0d1c259702f01872b6316cca2d526052d2436d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2792ff3369a073e4d1a5d0e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "幸好是配得上圣王的设计呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46c3ef6e8fb2776725c9d4dfb45208146e2f853df0b2d59574632e5473b5b065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02aee149a0877e2d8f9722d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着这个站在C位的我……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "47586a2df9fed4cd2f1bac29bd54b04fe90737f854d4db2265553d639a26158e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a08cac6d3060adc7faf5c6fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最适合圣王的果然是这套衣服，\r\n还有GＩ比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "aea903b79ed3f83f0f5b1603eda7c1304d36798dd790a3faae83db21b2ee83d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be2bde03946fef63231f98ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套服装的设计图是我画的喔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d3665709b07205c46bd3919c4a66dc33c3db364e3b677afc3bbc7b981a85590",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5429fb9f55fc9981dc22fc8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是才华洋溢的设计对吧？\r\n尽管看到出神都没关系喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "32c7075ea9794eb922923cc2fade4c1e31ce581271b91298ddb989ffa9f3b312",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b13f1463f9d738f469d47a83",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我才是一流的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e47271780e97afa9bff1fecaafb145bc2eb9e39990ca043a0f376eb802bc1e0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74f56680a5bdaa068afd119d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你们看看一流的舞蹈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f17146a93f8b50a484f87fc25dc590bd8825fe40dcd21b79b4b3917639d1c62",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7eaf42007f3679188854647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "将我这身优雅的装扮！\r\n深深烙印在眼底吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5abf651e6934c513886408c0023a4b958c4bb3167e9ca71ef6f6194c01ba5c18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41a679fb79015aabeb1a9596",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，赐予你们看着身穿便服的\r\n帝王看到着迷的权利吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0cbc910556c3d865915bbf1064afeabd9f0861b5763d42db73bdb8f3caca4de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23d1a90a6a14a1e916d5d7bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "隅々まで凝ったデザインでしょう？\r\n当然ね！キングが直々に監修したのだから！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4418a30dfb860241d15b0f8705358233763a78f5bb241db972262a0521790d96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0115f3778d60847758d496",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お母さまからの評価？\r\n…さぁね、ご想像にお任せするわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7a3ba876c8402261b5ed91c64f9b82c3f45e9fe26c26ad80ae4aeeda678028",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "70217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10777da78db9d7c7a5ced806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如何？有种一流优等生的感觉吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4acc1be0765c9770d554992b11304d370a3614478610f14907dfeed6729b0c1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1061",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
